#: src/languages/luau.md:3
msgid "Luau"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/luau.md:5
msgid ""
"[Luau](https://luau.org/) is a fast, small, safe, gradually typed, "
"embeddable scripting language derived from Lua. Luau was developed by Roblox "
"and is available under the MIT license."
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/luau.md:7
msgid ""
"Luau language support in Zed is provided by the community-maintained [Luau "
"extension](https://github.com/4teapo/zed-luau). Report issues to: [https://"
"github.com/4teapo/zed-luau/issues](https://github.com/4teapo/zed-luau/issues)"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/luau.md:10
msgid ""
